","value":"<p>@Localize[PF2E.NPC.Abilities.Glossary.SwarmMind]</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"swarm-mind","_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[],"rarity":"common"},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder Bestiary","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"category":"defensive","actions":{"value":null},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""},"weapon":{"value":""}},"type":"action","flags":{"core":{}},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"5.1.1","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1688938468970,"modifiedTime":1688938468970,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.bestiary-ability-glossary-srd.Item.baA0nSMhQyFyJIia","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null},"_id":"6FuHOusMObNExH89"},{"type":"action","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","name":"Greedy Souls","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>A money-grubber's existence is linked to the coins they steal. If a creature successfully Steals coins from the swarm, the swarm is dealt @Damage[1d4[mental]] damage, or mental damage equal to the number of coins stolen, whichever is lower.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":null,"_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[]},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"category":"defensive","actions":{"value":null},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""}},"effects":[],"_id":"zDyTDqRyKQ2NAHjA","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"5.3.0","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1688938532468,"modifiedTime":1691261013045,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"type":"action","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","name":"Nourishing Spirits","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>Any spirit, undead, or creature with negative healing inside a money- grubber swarm can take a single manipulate action with the evil trait to consume a handful of money-grubbers. This deals @Damage[1d4[mental]] damage to the swarm, and the creature gains temporary hit points equal to the damage dealt for 1 minute. If the creature was an undead spirit, it also gains a +1 status to attack rolls and damage rolls for 1 minute. A creature can only gain these benefits from eating money-grubbers once per hour.</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.battlezoo-bestiary-su-pf2e.pf2e-battlezoo-su-effects.Item.sr3HmSgwjQyIsuDH]{Effect: Nourishing Spirits}</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":null,"_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[]},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"category":"defensive","actions":{"value":null},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""}},"effects":[],"_id":"geDHhxG4JxEUpVw0","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"5.3.0","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1688938533016,"modifiedTime":1691261013061,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"type":"action","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","name":"Penny Pinching","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>The money- grubber swarm rummages through the possessions of all the creatures within its space in order to steal their shiniest coins, attempting a Thievery check against all the creatures' Reflex DCs.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The money-grubbers can steal up to [[/br 1d4]] coins from the creature, prioritizing the shiniest ones, at the GM's discretion. The constant tickling and pinching also deal @Damage[1d4[mental]] damage to the creature.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The money-grubbers fail to steal any coins, but they still deal @Damage[1[mental]] damage to the creature.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":null,"_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[]},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"action"},"category":"offensive","actions":{"value":2},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""}},"effects":[],"_id":"FnDFNoH7XBGBVRjg","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"5.3.0","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1688938536783,"modifiedTime":1691261013079,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}}],"flags":{},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"6.1.0","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1685401626117,"modifiedTime":1736542895135,"lastModifiedBy":"l2rbNx2a8f5ocpeL","compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null},"_id":"Jv1sYa1MSLhTu4ub","folder":"QqEyWiBhCvupt0ox","ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"sort":0}